        "description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Familiar and delectable. Hypnotic and decadent. Vanilla Skin, unlike any vanilla fragrance, evokes an iconic creaminess wrapped in a kaleidoscope of spice and intrigue. The dual nature of pink pepper and sugar settle down through rich cashmere before nestling into a core of addictive vanilla and cozy sandalwood. Vanilla Skin is a multidimensional take on an intoxicating sensual gourmand.</p><p>For a longer-lasting, more intense version of this best-selling fragrance, try the <a href=\"/products/vanilla-skin-perfume\">Vanilla Skin Perfume</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Notes",
            "content": "<p>Top: Pink Pepper, Pink Apple, Sugar Crystals<br>Heart: Lily, Jasmine Petals, Cashmere Wood<br>Base: Benzoin, Vanilla, Sandalwood, Agarwood</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "use_ingredients_metafield": true,
            "content": "<p>Alcohol Denat.<br>Water/Eau/Aqua<br>Fragrance/Parfum*</p><p>*Fragrance Ingredients: Ethylene Brassylate, Dimethylcyclohexylethoxy Isobutylpropanoate, Tetrahydro-Methyl-Methylpropyl)-Pyran-4-Ol, Ethyl Hydroxypyrone, Ethyl Vanillin, Vanillin, Methyl dihydrojasmonate, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Oxacycloheptadec-10-EN-2-One, Dipropylene Glycol, Methyl Hydrogenated Rosinate, Isopropyl Myristate, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate, Farnesol, Limonene.</p>"
          }
        },
